      "text": "these signs shall follow them that believe, Mark 16:17 (Morm. 9:24; Ether 4:18; D&C 58:64; 84:65; 124:98). ye shall receive power, after that the Holy Ghost is come, Acts 1:8. began to speak with other tongues, Acts 2:4 (4:31; 10:46). he, being full of the Holy Ghost … saw the glory of God, Acts 7:55. God anointed Jesus … with the Holy Ghost … who went about … healing, Acts 10:38. God gave them the like gift as he did unto us, Acts 11:17. being sanctified by the Holy Ghost, Rom. 15:16 (3 Ne. 27:20). every man hath his proper gift of God, 1 Cor. 7:7. there are diversities of gifts, 1 Cor. 12:4. to another the word of knowledge by the same Spirit, 1 Cor. 12:8. covet earnestly the best gifts, 1 Cor. 12:31. desire spiritual gifts, 1 Cor. 14:1. Quench not the Spirit, 1 Thes. 5:19. thou stir up the gift of God, which is in thee, 2 Tim. 1:6. God also bearing them witness … with divers miracles, and gifts of the Holy Ghost, Heb. 2:4.",
